      <div class="skeleton-description">
        <p>
          Mikołaj właśnie kończy trzydzieści lat i&nbsp;nie dość, że postanawia
          iść na studia, to w&nbsp;dodatku zamieszkuje w&nbsp;akademiku.
          Oczywiście nie jest do końca przekonany do swojego pomysłu, ponieważ
          –&nbsp;jak sam twierdzi –&nbsp;rozpocząć studia i&nbsp;zamieszkać
          w&nbsp;akademiku w&nbsp;wieku trzydziestu lat to niemal to samo co
          skończyć osiemnastkę i&nbsp;na drugi dzień zapisać się do
          przedszkolnej grupy starszaków.
        </p>
        <p>
          Co więcej, Mikołaj zostaje posądzony o&nbsp;morderstwo, które na
          początku wydawało się jedynie samobójstwem w&nbsp;akademikowej kuchni.
          Razem z&nbsp;policjantem, który postanawia mu pomóc, musi odnaleźć
          zabójcę, a&nbsp;co ważniejsze, przywrócić wiarę w&nbsp;zasadę, że
          „najlepsze imprezy zawsze przenoszą się do kuchni".
        </p>
        <p>I&nbsp;gdzie tu jeszcze znaleźć czas, żeby zostać gwiazdą rocka?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .skeleton-book {
    width: 100%;
    height: 800px;
    background-color: var(--base-light-background);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .skeleton-book-wrapper {
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1180px;
    /* background-color: lightseagreen; */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
    position: relative;
    width: 439px;
    height: 628px;
  }

  .cover-container-skeleton {
    height: 628px;
    width: 439px;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    background-size: contain;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .cover-plate-skeleton {
    height: 628px;
    width: 439px;
    background: var(--rockstar-orange);
    position: absolute;
    top: 25px;
    right: 25px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .book-read-container-skeleton {
    height: 90%;
    width: 50%;
    /* background-color: lightskyblue; */
    display: flex;
    /* justify-content: center; */
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 45px;
  }

  .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
    height: 100px;
    width: 100%;
    /* background-color: lightpink; */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    padding: 0 80px;
  }

  .skeleton-download-button {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: "Manrope";
    font-weight: 400;
    color: white;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--rockstar-orange);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .skeleton-download-button:hover {
    background: #f07459;
  }

  .skeleton-download-button > svg {
    width: 23px;
    margin-left: 10px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out;
  }

  .skeleton-download-button:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }

  .skeleton-download-button:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }

  .skeleton-description {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    /* background-color: lightcoral; */
    padding: 20px 85px;
  }

  .skeleton-description p {
    color: var(--base-text-color);
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 1200 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 1200px) {
    .skeleton-book-wrapper {
      max-width: 1100px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      position: relative;
      width: 402px;
      height: 575px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 575px;
      width: 402px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 575px;
      width: 402px;
    }

    .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
      padding: 0 40px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      padding: 20px 60px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 1100 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 1100px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 700px;
    }

    .skeleton-book-wrapper {
      max-width: 1000px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      width: 367px;
      height: 525px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 525px;
      width: 367px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 525px;
      width: 367px;
    }

    .book-read-container-skeleton {
      padding-top: 35px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      padding: 10px 50px;
    }

    .skeleton-description p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 1000 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
    .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
      height: auto;
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
      padding-top: 25px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      padding: 10px 40px;
    }

    .skeleton-description p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
  /* ---------------------------- 950 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 950px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 1400px;
    }

    .skeleton-book-wrapper {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-around;
      align-items: center;
      width: 500px;
    }

    .book-read-container-skeleton {
      margin-top: 340px;
      width: 600px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      position: relative;
      width: 439px;
      height: 628px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 628px;
      width: 439px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 628px;
      width: 439px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 10px 50px;
    }

    .skeleton-description p {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 615 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 615px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 1375px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      width: 402px;
      height: 575px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 575px;
      width: 402px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 575px;
      width: 402px;
    }

    .book-read-container-skeleton {
      margin-top: 280px;
      width: 500px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 10px 35px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 515 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 515px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 1340px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      width: 315px;
      height: 450px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 450px;
      width: 315px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 450px;
      width: 315px;
    }

    .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
      height: auto;
      width: 100%;
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 0 25px;
      padding-top: 5px;
    }

    .book-read-container-skeleton {
      margin-top: 170px;
      width: 415px;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px 25px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 430 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 430px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 1310px;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      width: 300px;
      height: 429px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 429px;
      width: 300px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      height: 429px;
      width: 300px;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
    }

    .book-read-container-skeleton {
      margin-top: 135px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .skeleton-description {
      margin-top: 5px;
      padding: 10px 35px;
    }

    .skeleton-buttons-wrapper {
      padding: 0 35px;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------------------------- 400 px ---------------------------------- */

  @media screen and (max-width: 400px) {
    .skeleton-book {
      height: 1400px;
    }

    .cover-plate-skeleton {
      display: none;
    }

    .cover-container-wrapper-skeleton {
      width: 320px;
      height: 458px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .cover-container-skeleton {
      height: 458px;
      width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>

